WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
Give every project more depth, texture, realism, and control.

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:09.000
The Red Giant October 2026 release brings together five powerful updates for VFX artists,

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:13.840
motion designers, and content creators, each designed to make sophisticated visual effects

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:16.640
faster, more intuitive, and more art-directable.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:22.460
New in Red Giant 2027, Scene Light introduces AI-powered depth-aware relighting directly

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:26.620
inside After Effects, helping artists place lights into footage with natural fall-off

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:30.320
and scene interaction while keeping results fully in their hands.

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:34.720
You can use it to integrate your VFX more realistically in a shot, create day-for-night effects,

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:36.020
or just change the mood.

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:40.060
For more on Scene Light, check out Chad's new tutorial on the Red Giant YouTube channel.

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:42.780
One of our top feature requests is finally here!

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:48.200
Red Giant 2027 brings Cinema 4D's legendary procedural noise patterns into your timeline

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:50.540
or composite with Universe Maxon Noise.

00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:55.680
Now, creators with Red Giant or Universe subscription can use these powerful GPU-accelerated tools

00:00:55.680 --> 00:01:00.780
to build distinctive textures, animated maps, transitions, and abstract effects with amazing

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:01.860
detail and control.

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:05.280
Learn more about Maxon Noise in Red Giant with Chad's new tutorial.

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:07.580
You can even use it for Real Lens Flares custom schmutz.

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:10.340
That's right, you've asked and we've delivered.

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:15.140
In this update, Real Lens Flares adds custom schmutz textures for even more control over your

00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:16.680
VFX and motion graphics.

00:01:16.880 --> 00:01:20.960
Plus, expanded light source types for even more realistic real-world lighting.

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:25.200
For a deep dive into the new features in Real Lens Flares, check out Max's new tutorial

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:26.600
on the Red Giant YouTube channel.

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:29.020
Chromatic displacement arrives in Autograph.

00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:33.740
With the organic prismatic distortion that you love, use it for force fields, refractions,

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:36.100
heat ripples, transitions, and bold design work.

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:40.000
Maxon Studio adds custom UI support so you can make advanced red giant...
